  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (Amazon EventBridge) can be configured to receive Amazon GuardDuty findings as events. Option B (AWS Lambda) functions can then be triggered by these EventBridge rules to execute automated remediation actions based on the finding details. Option C (Amazon S3) is primarily for object storage and not directly used for automating remediation logic. Option D (AWS Config) is for configuration management and compliance, not direct remediation orchestration. Option E (Amazon CloudWatch) is for monitoring and logging, but EventBridge is the primary service for routing events for automated responses.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain54_12',
