  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS CloudTrail Insights) is designed to detect unusual API activity by analyzing AWS CloudTrail event data, identifying anomalies in API call patterns. Option B (VPC Flow Logs) captures metadata about IP traffic flowing through your VPC, which can be analyzed to detect network-layer anomalies such as unusual traffic patterns or unauthorized connections. Option C (Amazon Security Hub) aggregates findings from various services but does not perform the direct detection of API activity or network anomalies itself. Option D (Amazon Macie) focuses on sensitive data discovery in S3. Option E (AWS Config) monitors resource configuration changes for compliance.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain54_12',
  NOW(),
  34,
