  'Option A (AWS CloudTrail Insights) is specifically designed to detect unusual API activity by analyzing AWS CloudTrail events. Option B (Amazon Macie) is a data security and privacy service that uses machine learning to discover, classify, and protect sensitive data, including PII, stored in Amazon S3. Option C (Amazon GuardDuty) is a threat detection service that monitors for malicious activity but doesn''t primarily focus on sensitive data discovery or unusual API activity detection. Option D (AWS Config) monitors resource configurations for compliance. Option E (Amazon Security Hub) aggregates findings from other services but doesn''t perform the direct detection itself.',
