VALUES (
  'q_54_m_54_1_94',
  'A security team needs to establish an automated remediation for Amazon GuardDuty findings that indicate a compromised EC2 instance. Order the following steps to configure an automated response using AWS services.',
  'ordering',
  '["Create an AWS Lambda function to perform remediation actions, such as isolating the EC2 instance.","Configure an Amazon EventBridge rule to filter GuardDuty findings for specific threat types.","Grant the Lambda function necessary IAM permissions to interact with EC2 and other services.","Set the EventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function when a matching GuardDuty finding is detected."]'::json,
  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'The correct sequence for setting up automated GuardDuty finding remediation begins with Option B: configuring an Amazon EventBridge rule to specifically capture relevant GuardDuty findings. Next, Option A: create the AWS Lambda function that will execute the remediation logic. Then, Option C: ensure the Lambda function has the appropriate IAM permissions to perform its intended actions (e.g., modifying security groups). Finally, Option D: link the EventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function upon a finding match, completing the automated workflow.',
