  'For multi-account GuardDuty setup, the first step (Option D) is to designate a GuardDuty administrator account within AWS Organizations. Next, (Option B) enable GuardDuty in this administrator account. Then, (Option A) the administrator account invites member accounts to join the GuardDuty organization. Finally, (Option C) each member account accepts the invitation, centralizing finding management under the administrator account.',
