  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To integrate AWS Config, first (Option A) enable AWS Config for all resources in the AWS account to start recording configuration changes. Next, (Option B) define custom AWS Config rules or use managed rules to check for specific compliance requirements. Then, (Option C) review the compliance dashboard and findings in the AWS Config console to assess the current state. Finally, (Option D) integrate AWS Config findings with AWS Security Hub to centralize security posture management.',
