  '{0,2,1,3}',
  'To conduct a vulnerability assessment with Amazon Inspector, first (Option A) configure Inspector to target the desired EC2 instances or container images. Next, (Option C) ensure the Inspector agent is deployed on EC2 instances or that image scanning is enabled for container images. Then, (Option B) review the findings generated by Inspector, prioritizing based on severity. Finally, (Option D) address the identified vulnerabilities according to the recommendations provided.',
