  '{0,1,3,2}',
  'To enable and configure AWS Security Hub, first (Option A) enable Security Hub in the AWS Management Console. Next, (Option B) enable desired security standards like AWS Foundational Security Best Practices or CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark. Then, (Option D) integrate other AWS security services such as GuardDuty, Macie, and Config to centralize their findings in Security Hub. Finally, (Option C) review the aggregated security findings and compliance status within the Security Hub console.',
