  'To automate remediation for GuardDuty findings, the correct sequence of steps is to first create an Amazon EventBridge rule (Option C) that filters for specific GuardDuty findings. Once the rule is in place, an AWS Lambda function (Option A) is needed to execute the desired remediation logic. This Lambda function must then be configured with the appropriate IAM permissions (Option B) to perform its actions. Finally, the EventBridge rule''s target should be defined to invoke this Lambda function (Option D) when a matching GuardDuty finding occurs.',
