  'A security operations center (SOC) wants to proactively detect unusual API activity that might indicate a compromised account or insider threat. They need to identify deviations from normal behavior in AWS CloudTrail logs without manually sifting through vast amounts of data, aiming for early detection of potential security incidents.',
  'ordering',
