  '{2,0,3,1}',
  'To leverage AWS CloudTrail Insights for anomaly detection, it must first be enabled and given time to learn. Option C (correct) is the initial setup. Option A (correct) is a passive but necessary step where Insights builds its understanding of normal behavior. Option D (correct) then establishes the proactive alerting mechanism for detected anomalies. Option B (correct) is the ongoing operational task to investigate and respond to the generated findings. This sequence ensures effective and automated anomaly detection.',
