VALUES (
  'q_54_m_54_2_140',
  'A healthcare provider stores vast amounts of patient data, including sensitive PII and PHI, in Amazon S3 buckets. They need to continuously monitor these buckets for the presence of unencrypted sensitive data and ensure that no PII is accidentally exposed or stored in non-compliant ways. Match the Amazon Macie capability to its sensitive data protection objective.',
