  NULL,
  'To discover sensitive data across S3 buckets, Amazon Macie offers automated sensitive data discovery jobs. To identify unencrypted PII and PHI, Macie utilizes managed data identifiers specifically designed to detect these types of information. To monitor public buckets for potential exposure, Macie performs S3 bucket policy evaluation to identify publicly accessible buckets. To alert on policy violations or sensitive data findings, Macie can generate security findings that are sent to AWS Security Hub for centralized management.',
