  NULL,
  'To detect proprietary data formats or complex patterns, custom data identifiers with regular expressions (regex) are used in Amazon Macie. To identify specific patterns or keywords, custom data identifiers can also be configured with keywords. To exclude known safe data from being flagged as sensitive, allow lists can be configured for specific S3 prefixes or object tags. To ensure all relevant objects are scanned, configuring Macie discovery jobs with appropriate scope and scheduling is necessary.',
