  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is Amazon Inspector, which is an automated security assessment service that helps improve the security and compliance of applications deployed on AWS by scanning Amazon EC2 instances and container images for vulnerabilities. Option A (AWS WAF) is a web application firewall. Option C (AWS Shield Advanced) provides DDoS protection. Option D (AWS Config) monitors resource configuration changes.',
