  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) describes the purpose of an AWS Lambda execution role. This IAM role grants the Lambda function the necessary permissions to interact with other AWS services, such as writing logs to Amazon CloudWatch or accessing data in Amazon DynamoDB. Option B relates to VPC configuration, Option C relates to resource-based policies, and Option D relates to function configuration settings.',
