  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is AWS WAF. It provides managed rule groups that are pre-configured sets of rules designed to protect against common web exploits, including those listed in the OWASP Top 10, without requiring customers to write individual rules. Option A (AWS Shield Advanced) provides DDoS protection. Option B (Amazon Inspector) scans for vulnerabilities in EC2 instances and container images. Option D (AWS Network Firewall) provides stateful inspection for VPC traffic.',
