  'mcq',
  '["AWS Network Firewall","VPC Reachability Analyzer","Security Groups","Network Access Control Lists (NACLs)"]'::json,
  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is VPC Reachability Analyzer, a diagnostic tool that performs a ''what-if'' analysis to determine network reachability and pinpoint blocking configurations. Option A (AWS Network Firewall), Option C (Security Groups), and Option D (NACLs) are network security controls, not analysis tools for reachability.',
