VALUES (
  'q_56_m_56_4_37',
  'Which AWS service helps diagnose network connectivity issues between two resources in your Amazon VPCs, such as an EC2 instance and a VPC endpoint, by analyzing the network path?',
  'mcq',
  '["Amazon VPC Flow Logs","AWS Network Firewall","AWS Systems Manager Session Manager","VPC Reachability Analyzer"]'::json,
  '{3}',
  'Option D (correct) is VPC Reachability Analyzer, a network diagnostics tool that enables you to analyze and debug network reachability between two resources in your VPCs. It identifies potential connectivity issues and suggests remediation. Option A, Amazon VPC Flow Logs, captures IP traffic information but does not analyze reachability paths. Option B, AWS Network Firewall, is a firewall service, not a diagnostic tool. Option C, AWS Systems Manager Session Manager, provides secure access to EC2 instances but does not analyze network paths.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain56_12',
  NOW(),
  87,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_56_4',
