  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is VPC Reachability Analyzer. It is designed to analyze network paths between specified source and destination points, identifying any blocking components like security groups, NACLs, or route table entries that prevent traffic flow. Option A (AWS Systems Manager Patch Manager) is for automating software patching. Option B (Amazon Inspector) is for vulnerability scanning. Option D (AWS WAF) is a web application firewall for edge protection, not for internal VPC network troubleshooting.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain56_12',
  NOW(),
  101,
  NULL,
  NULL,
