  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To use AWS IAM Access Analyzer for identifying unused access, the first step is to Option A (enable IAM Access Analyzer for the relevant AWS Region). Once enabled, it will analyze access patterns, and you can then Option B (review the generated findings specifically for unused access). Next, Option C (identify the IAM principals (users, roles) with unused permissions) highlighted by the findings. Finally, Option D (refine the IAM policies to remove unnecessary or unused permissions) to enforce least privilege.',
