  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'The first step to use AWS IAM Identity Center is to Option B (Enable AWS IAM Identity Center in the AWS Organizations management account). Once enabled, you must Option A (Choose an external identity source). After selecting the source, Option C (Configure the connection between IAM Identity Center and the chosen identity source) is required to establish trust. Finally, Option D (Synchronize users and groups from the identity source to IAM Identity Center) populates IAM Identity Center with your workforce identities, which can then be assigned permissions.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain57_12',
