VALUES (
  'q_57_m_57_1_125',
  'A mobile application needs to access AWS resources using temporary credentials, federating through an external identity provider (IdP) and AWS STS `AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`. Order the general flow for obtaining these credentials.',
  'ordering',
  '["The mobile application calls `sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity` with the IdP token.","The mobile application receives temporary AWS security credentials.","The end-user authenticates with the external identity provider (e.g., Google, Facebook).","The external identity provider returns an authentication token to the mobile application."]'::json,
  '{2,3,0,1}',
  'The process begins with user authentication. Option C (The end-user authenticates with the external identity provider) is the first step. Upon successful authentication, Option D (The external identity provider returns an authentication token to the mobile application). The application then uses this token to Option A (The mobile application calls `sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`). Finally, Option B (The mobile application receives temporary AWS security credentials) from AWS STS, which can then be used to access AWS resources.',
