  '["Define the role''s identity-based permissions policy.","Create an IAM policy that defines the maximum permissions allowed for the roles.","Create the new IAM role.","Attach the maximum permissions policy as a permission boundary to the IAM role."]'::json,
  '{1,2,3,0}',
  'To implement a permission boundary, you must first Option B (Create an IAM policy that defines the maximum permissions allowed for the roles). This policy sets the upper limit. Next, Option C (Create the new IAM role). Then, Option D (Attach the maximum permissions policy as a permission boundary to the IAM role). Finally, Option A (Define the role''s identity-based permissions policy), ensuring these permissions are a subset of the boundary.',
