  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'The migration process begins with identity integration. First, Option B (Integrate IAM Identity Center with the organization''s corporate identity provider) to establish the source of truth for identities. Next, Option A (Configure permission sets in IAM Identity Center) to define the specific access levels. Then, Option C (Assign users and groups from the identity provider to the created permission sets) to grant access. Finally, Option D (Communicate the new access method and transition existing IAM users to use IAM Identity Center) to complete the migration and decommission old access methods.',
