  '["Review IAM Access Analyzer''s findings for unused access.","Modify or remove the identified unused permissions from IAM policies.","Identify IAM principals (users or roles) with unused permissions.","Monitor for new unused access findings to maintain least privilege."]'::json,
  '{0,2,1,3}',
  'To reduce overly permissive policies, first Option A (Review IAM Access Analyzer''s findings for unused access) to identify potential areas for reduction. Then, Option C (Identify IAM principals with unused permissions) to pinpoint which entities are over-provisioned. Next, Option B (Modify or remove the identified unused permissions from IAM policies) to implement the principle of least privilege. Finally, Option D (Monitor for new unused access findings) to ensure ongoing adherence to security best practices.',
