  '["The IAM user registers an MFA device with their AWS account.","Attach an IAM policy to the user or group that explicitly requires MFA for sensitive actions.","The IAM user attempts to perform a sensitive API action, triggering the MFA requirement.","Verify that the MFA enforcement policy is working as expected."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To enforce MFA, the user must first have an MFA device. So, Option A (The IAM user registers an MFA device with their AWS account). Next, Option B (Attach an IAM policy to the user or group that explicitly requires MFA for sensitive actions) to define the enforcement rule. Then, Option C (The IAM user attempts to perform a sensitive API action, triggering the MFA requirement) to test the setup. Finally, Option D (Verify that the MFA enforcement policy is working as expected) to confirm security.',
