  '{2,0,1,3}',
  'To configure real-time alerts for CloudTrail API calls, the first step is to ensure CloudTrail logs are sent to CloudWatch Logs (Option C). Once logs are flowing, a CloudWatch metric filter must be created to identify the specific API call pattern within those logs (Option A). Following this, a CloudWatch Alarm is configured to monitor the metric generated by the filter and trigger when the event occurs (Option B). Finally, an Amazon SNS topic is set up as the action for the CloudWatch Alarm to send notifications (Option D).',
