  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'Setting up AWS Security Lake begins with enabling the service in the desired AWS Region (Option B). Once enabled, the next step is to configure the various data sources (such as CloudTrail or VPC Flow Logs) that will contribute logs to Security Lake (Option A). After data sources are configured, subscribers are defined to consume the aggregated security data, allowing other security tools to access it (Option C). Finally, the centralized and normalized security data can be analyzed using integrated tools (Option D).',
