  'To enable CloudTrail log file validation, first navigate to the CloudTrail console (Option A). Then, select the specific trail for which validation needs to be enabled (Option B). Next, edit the trail settings and locate the option to enable ''Log file validation'' (Option C). Finally, save the changes to apply the validation (Option D). Without log file validation, tampered or deleted CloudTrail logs are undetectable, which is an anti-pattern (ap-2.1-001).',
