  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To enable Route 53 Resolver query logging, first, create an Amazon CloudWatch Logs log group or an Amazon S3 bucket to serve as the destination for the query logs (Option A). Next, navigate to the Route 53 console, select ''Resolver'', and then ''Query logging'' (Option B). Then, choose ''Configure query logging'' and select the specific VPCs for which logging should be enabled (Option C). Finally, select the previously created destination (CloudWatch Logs log group or S3 bucket) and create the query logging configuration (Option D).',
