VALUES (
  'q_55_m_55_3_95',
  'A compliance team requires immutable audit logs for all AWS account activity, stored in a separate security account. Order the steps to set up this logging solution.',
  'ordering',
  '["Create an organization trail in the management account, configured for all accounts.","Configure the S3 bucket policy in the security account to deny ''s3:DeleteObject'' for all but specific roles.","Enable CloudTrail log file validation for the organization trail.","Specify an Amazon S3 bucket in the dedicated security account for centralized log delivery."]'::json,
  '{0,3,2,1}',
  'To set up immutable audit logs centrally, first, create an organization trail in the management account, configured for all accounts (Option A). This centralizes logging and prevents member accounts from disabling it (anti-pattern ap-2.1-002). Next, specify an Amazon S3 bucket in the dedicated security account for centralized log delivery (Option D). Then, enable CloudTrail log file validation for the organization trail (Option C) to ensure log integrity (anti-pattern ap-2.1-001). Finally, configure the S3 bucket policy in the security account to deny ''s3:DeleteObject'' for all but specific, highly restricted roles, ensuring immutability (Option B).',
