  '["Log in to the AWS Organizations management account.","Navigate to the CloudTrail console.","Create a new trail and select the option for an organization trail.","Specify an Amazon S3 bucket in a dedicated logging account for log delivery."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To configure an organization trail for centralized CloudTrail logging, the first step is to log in to the AWS Organizations management account (Option A), as organization trails can only be created from there. Next, navigate to the CloudTrail console (Option B). Then, create a new trail and explicitly select the option to make it an organization trail (Option C). Finally, specify an Amazon S3 bucket, preferably in a dedicated logging account, for the delivery of all logs from the organization''s accounts (Option D).',
