  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To enable VPC Flow Logs and send them to Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose, first create an Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream (Option A). Next, configure this Kinesis Data Firehose stream with its ultimate destination, such as an Amazon S3 bucket for storage or Amazon OpenSearch Service for analysis (Option B). Then, create VPC Flow Logs for the desired VPCs or network interfaces (Option C). Finally, specify the Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream as the destination for the VPC Flow Logs (Option D), ensuring that network traffic data is streamed for processing.',
