  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To ensure CloudTrail logs are delivered and retained, first create an Amazon S3 bucket, ideally in a dedicated logging account (Option A). Next, configure the S3 bucket policy to explicitly allow CloudTrail to write logs to it (Option B). Then, create an AWS CloudTrail trail and specify this S3 bucket as the destination for log delivery (Option C). Finally, configure S3 Lifecycle rules on the bucket (Option D) to manage log retention, transitioning older logs to lower-cost storage classes or expiring them after the required period.',
