  'ordering',
  '["Configure the log sources (e.g., VPC Flow Logs, CloudWatch Logs) to send data to the Kinesis Data Firehose.","Create an Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream.","Specify the destination for the Firehose stream (e.g., Amazon S3, Amazon OpenSearch Service).","Verify the data flow and successful delivery to the chosen destination."]'::json,
  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To set up a Kinesis Data Firehose for real-time log ingestion, the first step is to create the Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream itself (Option B). During creation, the destination for the Firehose stream must be specified, such as an Amazon S3 bucket for archival or Amazon OpenSearch Service for analysis (Option C). Once the Firehose stream is ready, configure the various log sources (e.g., VPC Flow Logs, CloudWatch Logs subscriptions) to send their data to this Firehose stream (Option A). Finally, it''s crucial to verify the data flow to ensure that logs are being successfully ingested by Firehose and delivered to the configured destination (Option D).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain55_12',
  NOW(),
  36,
  NULL,
