  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To create a custom insight in AWS Security Hub, first, navigate to the AWS Security Hub console (Option A). Next, select ''Insights'' from the navigation pane and then choose ''Create insight'' (Option B). Then, define the filter criteria that will be used to aggregate relevant Security Hub findings (Option C). Finally, provide a descriptive name for the insight and create it to begin aggregating findings that match the specified criteria (Option D).',
