  'To set up an automated response workflow for Security Hub findings, the first step is to create an Amazon EventBridge rule (Option B). Next, specify the event pattern that the rule should match, in this case, AWS Security Hub findings with a critical severity (Option C). After defining the pattern, define the target action that EventBridge should take when a matching event occurs, such as invoking an AWS Lambda function or publishing to an Amazon SNS topic (Option A). Finally, it is crucial to test the EventBridge rule by generating a sample Security Hub finding to ensure the automated response triggers correctly (Option D).',
