  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To set up proactive security alerting, first ensure that AWS CloudTrail logs are being delivered to an Amazon CloudWatch Logs log group (Option B). This is a prerequisite for creating metric filters. Next, define a CloudWatch metric filter with a specific pattern to identify the suspicious API calls within the ingested CloudTrail logs (Option C). Once the metric filter is in place, create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm that uses this metric filter, setting a threshold for the number of matching events and configuring a notification method (Option A). Finally, verify the alarm triggers correctly by simulating the suspicious API call to confirm the entire setup functions as expected (Option D).',
