  '{0,1,3,2}',
  'To integrate CloudTrail logs with CloudWatch Logs for real-time analysis and alerting, the initial step is to create an AWS CloudTrail trail to capture management events (Option A). Next, configure this CloudTrail trail to send its logs to a new or existing Amazon CloudWatch Logs log group (Option B). After configuration, it''s important to verify that CloudTrail events are indeed appearing in the designated CloudWatch Logs log group (Option D) to ensure data flow. Once logs are flowing, create CloudWatch metric filters and alarms based on specific security events detected within the CloudWatch Logs log group (Option C).',
