  'To create a custom insight in AWS Security Hub, the initial step is to ensure AWS Security Hub is enabled in the relevant AWS Region (Option A). Once enabled, navigate to the Security Hub console and define a filter for findings based on the specific criteria for compliance violations, such as compliance status, resource type, or severity (Option B). After configuring the filter, save it as a new custom insight, giving it a descriptive name (Option C). Finally, the custom insight will appear in the Security Hub dashboard, allowing the analyst to view and monitor the specific compliance violations (Option D).',
