  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To verify CloudTrail data event configuration for AWS Lambda functions, first, navigate to the CloudTrail console and select the relevant trail (Option A). Next, edit the trail settings and review the ''Data events'' section (Option B). Then, confirm that ''Lambda'' is selected as a data event type (Option C). Finally, verify that either ''All Lambda functions'' or specific Lambda functions are configured for data event logging, depending on the requirement (Option D).',
