  'To configure VPC Flow Logs to deliver to Amazon CloudWatch Logs, first select the VPC or network interface for which to create flow logs (Option A). Next, create an IAM role with the necessary permissions for VPC Flow Logs to publish to CloudWatch Logs (Option C). Then, choose Amazon CloudWatch Logs as the destination for the flow logs and associate the IAM role (Option B). Finally, verify that flow log records appear in the specified CloudWatch Logs log group (Option D) to confirm successful delivery and logging.',
