  'AWS CloudTrail logs are failing to deliver to an Amazon S3 bucket due to a permissions issue. Order the steps to remediate the S3 bucket policy and restore CloudTrail log delivery.',
  'ordering',
  '["Identify the specific Amazon S3 bucket policy preventing CloudTrail log delivery.","Modify the S3 bucket policy to grant the necessary permissions for CloudTrail.","Review the required S3 bucket policy permissions for CloudTrail in AWS documentation.","Verify that CloudTrail log delivery to the S3 bucket has resumed successfully."]'::json,
  '{0,2,1,3}',
  'To remediate an S3 bucket policy preventing CloudTrail log delivery, the first step is to identify the specific Amazon S3 bucket policy that is causing the delivery failure (Option A). Next, consult the AWS documentation to review the exact S3 bucket policy permissions required for CloudTrail to successfully write logs (Option C). Following this, modify the identified S3 bucket policy to grant these necessary permissions to the CloudTrail service principal (Option B). Finally, verify that CloudTrail log delivery to the S3 bucket has resumed successfully by checking for new log files (Option D).',
