VALUES (
  'q_55_m_55_2_44',
  'Order the steps to suppress a specific GuardDuty finding that is identified as a false positive.',
  'ordering',
  '["Navigate to the GuardDuty console.","Select the specific finding you want to suppress.","Choose ''Actions'' and then ''Archive'' or ''Suppress finding''.","Define suppression rules based on finding attributes (e.g., resource ID, finding type) and specify the duration."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To suppress a GuardDuty finding, first, navigate to the GuardDuty console (Option A). Next, select the specific finding that has been identified as a false positive (Option B). Then, choose ''Actions'' and select ''Archive'' or ''Suppress finding'' (Option C). Finally, define the suppression rules based on relevant finding attributes (such as resource ID or finding type) and specify the duration for which the finding should be suppressed (Option D).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain55_12',
  NOW(),
  88,
