  'To filter findings in AWS Security Hub, first, navigate to the AWS Security Hub console (Option A). Next, select ''Findings'' from the navigation pane (Option B). Then, apply a filter for ''Severity'' and choose ''CRITICAL'' or ''HIGH'' to focus on the most important issues (Option C). Finally, review the filtered list of findings to prioritize remediation efforts (Option D).',
