  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To change the workflow status of a Security Hub finding, first, navigate to the AWS Security Hub console (Option A). Next, select ''Findings'' from the navigation pane (Option B). Then, select one or more findings that you wish to update (Option C). Finally, choose ''Actions'' and then ''Update workflow status'', selecting the appropriate status such as ''SUPPRESSED'' or ''RESOLVED'' (Option D).',
