  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To export AWS Security Hub findings, first, navigate to the AWS Security Hub console and select ''Findings'' (Option A). Next, apply any necessary filters to narrow down the specific findings you wish to export (Option B). Then, choose ''Actions'' and select ''Export findings'' (Option C). Finally, select the desired export format (e.g., CSV or JSON) and initiate the download (Option D).',
