  'A security analyst wants to streamline the review of high-severity findings in AWS Security Hub. Order the steps to filter Security Hub findings.',
  'ordering',
  '["Navigate to the AWS Security Hub console.","Select ''Findings'' from the navigation pane.","Apply filters based on severity, resource type, or other relevant attributes.","Save the applied filters as a custom insight for future use."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To streamline the review of high-severity findings in AWS Security Hub, the first step is to navigate to the AWS Security Hub console (Option A). Next, select ''Findings'' from the navigation pane (Option B) to view all aggregated findings. Then, apply filters based on criteria such as severity, resource type, or other relevant attributes to narrow down the findings (Option C). Finally, save the applied filters as a custom insight (Option D) for quick access and consistent review in the future.',
