  NULL,
  'An AWS Lambda Execution Role (left: 0) defines the permissions that an AWS Lambda function has to access other AWS services and resources. Amazon ECR Image Scanning (left: 1) automatically scans container images stored in Amazon ECR for known software vulnerabilities. Amazon Inspector (left: 2) provides automated security assessment for EC2 instances and container images to identify vulnerabilities. AWS Systems Manager Session Manager (left: 3) provides secure and auditable operational access to EC2 instances without needing to open inbound ports or manage SSH keys.',
