  NULL,
  'Least privilege for Lambda (left: 0) is achieved by configuring specific AWS Lambda Execution Roles that grant only the necessary permissions. Vulnerability scanning for EC2 (left: 1) is provided by Amazon Inspector, which automatically assesses instances for vulnerabilities. Secure access to instance metadata (left: 2) is enforced by IMDSv2, requiring a session token for all requests, mitigating SSRF attacks. Automated patching (left: 3) of operating systems and applications on EC2 instances is managed by AWS Systems Manager Patch Manager.',
