  '{"left":["Vulnerability scanning for container images","Runtime isolation for serverless containers","Least privilege for container tasks","Centralized patch compliance reporting"],"right":["Amazon ECR Image Scanning","AWS Fargate isolation","Amazon ECS Task Roles","AWS Systems Manager Compliance"]}'::json,
  '{"left":[0,1,2,3],"right":[0,1,2,3]}'::jsonb,
