  NULL,
  'Security Groups (Option A) operate at Layer 4 (TCP/UDP ports) for filtering. AWS Network Firewall (Option B) can perform Layer 7 (application layer) filtering, including protocol-specific inspection. AWS Firewall Manager (Option C) provides centralized management of firewall rules across multiple accounts and VPCs.',
