  '{2}',
  'Option C (Multi-Region keys) is the AWS KMS feature that allows you to create cryptographic keys that can be replicated and used in multiple AWS Regions. This is particularly useful for disaster recovery and multi-Region applications, as it allows data encrypted in one Region to be decrypted in another using the same key ID. Option A (Key policies) define access. Option B (Key rotation) automates key updates. Option D (Custom key stores) integrate KMS with CloudHSM or external key managers.',
