  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is Amazon Security Hub. It is designed to aggregate, organize, and prioritize security findings from various AWS security services and partner products into a single, centralized view. This allows for consolidated analysis and improved security posture management. Option B (AWS Config) assesses resource configurations. Option C (AWS Audit Manager) collects evidence for audits. Option D (AWS CloudFormation) provisions infrastructure.',
