  '{1}',
  'Option B (To deploy a standardized set of AWS Config rules and remediation actions) is the primary purpose of conformance packs. They allow you to define a common compliance baseline and deploy it consistently across multiple accounts and Regions. Option A describes Amazon Security Hub. Option C describes Service Control Policies (SCPs). Option D describes AWS Control Tower''s account vending capabilities.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain59_12',
