  '{1}',
  'Option B (To set guardrails that specify the maximum permissions for accounts) is the primary role of SCPs. They are organization policies that allow you to manage permissions for all accounts in your organization, acting as a security boundary. Option A describes IAM policies. Option C describes AWS Config. Option D describes AWS CloudFormation.',
