  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS Config conformance packs) allow you to define a standardized collection of AWS Config rules and remediation actions. This package can then be deployed across multiple accounts and Regions to assess and audit the compliance of resources consistently. Option A (AWS Organizations) manages accounts. Option B (AWS Control Tower) sets up a landing zone. Option D (Amazon Security Hub) aggregates security findings.',
