  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is what AWS Service Catalog primarily manages. It allows organizations to create and manage catalogs of IT services that are approved for use on AWS, ensuring compliance and governance. Option B (EC2 lifecycle) is managed by EC2 and Auto Scaling. Option C (Cross-account access) is managed by AWS IAM and Organizations. Option D (Encryption keys) is managed by AWS KMS.',
