  '["Detective control","Corrective control","Preventive control","Compensating control"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (Preventive control) is the most effective. Preventive controls, such as Service Control Policies (SCPs) or IAM permission boundaries, block non-compliant actions before they occur. For S3, an SCP could deny the creation of buckets without specific encryption settings. Option A (Detective control) identifies issues after they happen (e.g., AWS Config rule). Option B (Corrective control) fixes issues after they are detected. Option D (Compensating control) mitigates risk when a primary control cannot be fully implemented.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain59_12',
  NOW(),
  69,
  NULL,
