  '{2}',
  'Option C (It prevents unauthorized or non-compliant actions from happening) is the primary characteristic of a preventive control. Examples include Service Control Policies (SCPs), IAM permission boundaries, and resource policies that block actions before they can be executed. Option A describes a detective control. Option B describes a corrective control. Option D describes an audit/compliance control like AWS Audit Manager.',
