  '{1}',
  'Option B (AWS CloudFormation StackSets) is the most efficient solution for deploying common AWS resources like IAM roles and S3 bucket policies consistently across multiple AWS accounts and Regions. It allows a single CloudFormation template to be deployed to all target accounts with a single operation. Option A (AWS Service Catalog) is for end-user provisioning of approved products. Option C (AWS Organizations) manages accounts but not resource deployment. Option D (AWS Config) assesses configurations.',
