  'multiple',
  '["AWS Audit Manager for compliance evidence","Amazon GuardDuty for threat detection","Amazon Macie","AWS Config","AWS Service Catalog for resource provisioning"]'::json,
  '{2,3}',
  'Option C (Amazon Macie) is a data security and data privacy service that uses machine learning and pattern matching to discover and protect sensitive data in AWS, especially in Amazon S3. Option D (AWS Config) can be used to monitor S3 bucket configurations, such as public access settings and encryption status, to ensure they comply with security policies. AWS Audit Manager (Option A) is for collecting compliance evidence. Amazon GuardDuty (Option B) is for threat detection. AWS Service Catalog (Option E) is for provisioning approved resources.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain59_12',
  NOW(),
