  '{1,2}',
  'Option B (AWS Audit Manager) helps you continuously audit your AWS usage to simplify how you assess risk and compliance with regulations and industry standards. It automates the collection of evidence. Option C (Amazon Security Hub) collects security data from across AWS accounts, services, and third-party products, and helps you analyze your security posture against industry standards, which can serve as evidence. AWS CloudFormation (Option A) is for infrastructure provisioning. Amazon S3 (Option D) is for object storage. AWS Lambda (Option E) is for serverless compute.',
