  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Trusted Advisor) provides real-time guidance to help you provision your resources following AWS best practices across five categories, including cost optimization and security. Option B (AWS Well-Architected Tool) helps you review your architectures against the AWS Well-Architected Framework pillars, including Security, and provides recommendations for improvement. AWS CloudFormation (Option C) is for provisioning. AWS Service Catalog (Option D) is for self-service provisioning. Amazon S3 (Option E) is for object storage.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain59_12',
  NOW(),
  46,
  NULL,
